  "id": "c8d9ec6305ec626294a79cfe",
  "title": "忍者神龟3",
  "summary": "童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。 这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写《激龟忍者传》时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。 这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。 故事放到我身上，是加了料的： 话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届…",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c7620adf118d11e7b3892bb9a27f23ee9b45507dadd7a8a5d81b201252bbb20bb0816ac3a3c1fce866839c6be3b23b64ebcf06d3fa5a4b3f5658e5a75dfadb2c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3：曼哈顿计划</a></p>\n<p>童年阴影系列，微笑继续。本篇又名：一块披萨引发的回忆。<br>\n这是当年包机房里的大热门游戏。名字有点歧义，甚至我20年前写<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8a4f2d3a22c5e39cca71a57bdea24589cc0f21eac9ba019b56ef21099f1e0f8cd077f75cbe47e9027e6b6e8499d26711c876725333b25e29b043ab4325971d56e0571dc08f6c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">《激龟忍者传》</a>时的认知都是错的：日版是忍者神龟2，美版因为把激龟忍者传也算了进去，所以是忍者神龟3，盗版一般盗的是美版，所以也应该算3。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/cce1c8e3a7e2c8def54701ebeabb0cce09084fc0b9ac85feb503f680e857e4e85226b1c35acd64e25d780fd200a271537bc9b6e887044e330d7ac478cca3263c023dd0722e683a9f7abe4876019132a349b38d69ff75b33aef9739af85dd40cc3e2a429f213a69cd2f7c441c15e49e9ef9b393858aa70ebe\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_000\"></a></p>\n<p>这次的阴影不少人也能猜到：打不死的斯雷德。当年游戏开发商为了防止盗版，给游戏上了特殊的加密。最有名的就包括一碰就死的《外星战将》，第二关BOSS不死的《特救指令》和本作，第六关BOSS不死的《忍者神龟3》。显然，一碰就死和第二关过不去属于早死早升天的爽快死法，其伤害性远远小于打了一个多小时之后第六关过不去。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/68c7cf1ffcae933c2ae0e5f2c89fef507cb076ab7d32853e960416f1b7c0194f7fcb4da2085c03d70b2e0539ab8bb5fa55a8eca42c7da235071da24c2568b9f0489f463dc23a5b67f02ff0fa60e89823cab19a7a8939e1bd50f7b307ce2adce1d62e5b2f0f20a98d470947191574cb318b504e554ca4b358\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a></p>\n<p>故事放到我身上，是加了料的：<br>\n话说我大爷1991年秋天的时候再婚，大娘是寡妇带了个儿子。白捡的堂哥属羊头，我属猴屁股，他大我20个月，差不多两岁，高我一届。<br>\n大娘很快发现我妈是奶奶家这边的话事人，就千方百计讨好以达成间接讨好我妈的目的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/e4eda18d64da6bb84515f3942998c311bc2f202b450941d7d3c179b50c5a650121995a9c7bff4a2f56ec35243eef32230b4f325531ccb7d74e10e3520d2f846a055639622cd9945a2519cb619d7271676472727087d247dd94248341d8d5b3e95d0fd3cbbacbe81c8dc150b0083db4c83896f74490b11db0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_025\"></a></p>\n<p>1993年小升初暑假，我照例被寄存在奶奶家。某天，二手堂哥忽然来找我，要我去他家玩。<br>\n他说的“家”是我大娘自己原来的房子，离我大爷大娘那个万人大厂很近，离市区很远。<br>\n我犹豫了3秒就答应了。对我来说最大的吸引力在于，没大人管。二手堂哥那时不喜欢和我大爷住一起，准初二了而且是放假期间，吃饭只需要直接进厂去找我大娘。他是一个人住的。<br>\n此外他们家不光有厂内的闭路电视看，还承诺了要请我打电游。<br>\n他请我打的正是《忍者神龟3》。他们厂子那一带穷乡僻壤，电游厅（包机房）单价也便宜，1块钱40分钟。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/43294fcbd33f74046c3c25ca732d640f086a715a930a098e11d1960d78e11587dcc468d307804f0076e35e8784475ae902a6ba8d3dc7954eac9e29136fb944615fddfa387dd492abb4fd392f4166117d737b01e13ce60b03f84158540d00c6043de67a224800dda3e80dbdea2bd96050822567a80f4c75f4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_005\"></a></p>\n<p>防盗版机制令游戏难度直接变成HARD，敌人都变得皮糙血厚。他花第3块钱的时候我们才见到斯雷德。等我俩打了十几分钟斯雷德还打不死的时候，老板提示说时间要到了，并且友善提醒：这个斯雷德是打不死的，别白费力气了。<br>\n这时旁边有位观战的大哥忽然冒出一句：“只有打斯雷德之前一个馅饼（回血道具）都不吃才能把他打死。”<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/f5689dd394ec895c2bc9c3749b19a07587c86ea08a0016b7051805d48b3c1a22c1dd122530f79eedb21571ce296cde8dd1bc0d1f933ce32d52b48291d88e444278a9bc7d7c1a7be3e54838e5da3961d62c0f6ccee51c750ee429b3fbaf8fed8226adf225680c0cd16f58d6fb9f3a03b6ea878933379911a3\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_030\"></a></p>\n<p>第二天回家之后我妈因为我跟“外人”走了把我臭骂一顿。并且要求我找机会请二手堂哥玩点什么，不能占他便宜。<br>\n1993年的中秋节是9月30号。中秋节自己家聚会，第二天有远房亲戚来看望我奶奶。于是第二天的时候就拉他回请，继续玩《忍者神龟3》。<br>\n我奶奶家附近的包机房是正常的1块钱30分钟，但好运气，是30条命的hack版。这次花了4块钱。小心翼翼的不碰馅饼，结果涛声依旧。<br>\n不吃披萨也不能打死BOSS这件事让我直接龙场悟道：“爱科学，传谣不信谣。”<br>\n这也是为什么后来我在电游厅为什么能顺嘴说出“<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/982bf68db30be73ae7331d64f9e47330876b3051d07e5265074ac742a2c2ef5d88bc7f3257e602376ad7aab2a84c16d124f47c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">黑暗海豹</a>”去忽悠别人。既然吃了亏，就要拉更多的人进坑。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/69843145d7b7191bde2427aa72168115e08abb39f0bc3a5dea4d280edf4e73972c396e283ac7b83b4c62703ef250ca38955e6fd4ce5708105d25773454efb8a02838d7ccb84ad8ceadabcb0ae48e5e83a9805104968036ce3fb98214a785c3ff9d044e9b86798dfc0fdab6fd37bc3a46ff76794be12dc38a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_013\"></a></p>\n<p>要说当年就真的没有通关的方法了吗？倒也未必。除了有可能出现的正版卡以外，也有传闻，使用“魂斗罗30条命秘技”是可以选关的，把斯雷德跳过去不就行了。我和二手堂哥也都各自实验了一下，都没成功就放弃了。现在得知真相：《忍者神龟3代》美版选关秘技是<strong>↑↑↓↓←→←→AB</strong>，而我是熟练精准掌握魂斗罗秘技的，只按BA完事，二手堂哥是冗余派的BABA，我们都没按错，也不属于另外一个ABBA的错误派别，所以就一步之遥咯。<br>\n小马过河是世界上最好的寓言，只不过验证这件事，是要付出成本的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/8a046525799d11ef667b9de2b168babc53b7ebeb82ba49371f334e95195bf39c0724e3882d071eb3b205e31557339e43782ae6a545955296934761ce317f50ed4d13da28f91247002e7d31ffb4f7032977871f01f50c6b84fa404f2137ce73ac75b783b7417cc2aaca672dfde9ece4d390b89b3bdc566c6b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_018\"></a></p>\n<p>说回游戏。本作日版发行于1991年，美版是1992年，FC发展到此时已经是大成阶段，所以这款游戏在画质音乐都非常优秀，游戏性和趣味性比前作更是强出一大截。最大的特色是设计了不同的“绝招”代替之前的“扇脸蛋子”。最好用的依旧是达芬奇，双刀可以封线且多打BOSS几次；其次是多纳泰罗（爱因斯坦），翻滚攻击多段输出；拉斐尔的绝招类似街霸里警察的“窜电”，出招快，连打带跑，安全性高；米开朗基罗的绝招最差，出招慢且主要对空，适用范围极逼仄。<br>\n发这种大招是要掉血的，不过扣到最后一滴血就不会再扣了。由此也诞生了动作游戏小白最普遍的玩法：只要不停放大招就好。这种玩法有两个缺点，一是被碰一下就挂了；另一个是，因为绝招并不是两个键无脑同时按下，而是要先点一下跳在几帧之内再按拳，所以非常累手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/ded276dea4f6a707b80c066fc8d2a859fb0f7338eb2d118e31036e123d1bfc489a933baf836eb5c830aab7b38a240a3cacbd815bfc069b9efa75d169a3bab0ade50584047e6689af5844228c50acaaa0f40c167df2ec29ec176f2188297c20a46130700a53652ad8f366e62beecd1d2c9f22c59dca63e585\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_007\"></a></p>\n<p>高端的玩家玩法要优雅很多，他们用的是另一个新出的招式“下挑”，一般的福特兵一下一个。这招也非常累手，这回累的是左手。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/dccf49243b60c5a855bd2604038ef3906d1587e4ebde0d7bd1b4ddcd30cb56659d3ef0b8c157255c8f537de814439f4b0f1771fe3dc3094915ac0689e07c9af6872bdc39e29d0c046af83d0cc5e9f4f5a49cd4a1c2b8d360664f55187f1d337dbb4af2dfe5d66edcbe42b5efddc421dfb8fb9a47ed468441\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_006\"></a></p>\n<p>科纳米这次把福特兵的种类设计得异常丰富，长枪、铁桶、鞭子、铁砧、回旋镖，甚至还有专门扬沙子的。尤其倒数第二关有个电梯场景，所有敌人拉出来遛一圈，挺带感的。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/55ab0b0b0f03f861b6fb729e046558d4a6e13b3837a8e30e19289e7d4cbc64f37720b399e92fd982c72af1912be7d97845082093b316580c737815706dcea48214a5b349b1d84d3d50f9db8595b87be7c703745581e1e248d081fca7acb99d853673733fa264055c4ba26109928183bae876e51541068159\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_032\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/481bcdd95a1c1555344adc942cb81ffa752264a76e4c434fcdd020e13826de6642d229dcc0de03f8a35d670b534d613fc93ff619885727492da4c6226444d9427a483c88a6649ce93879ec9212953364479251071d1b030beb51c6a92b97369fd89ae3efdeb8991c4a1520c674287350a72bbc7b29577e1b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_023\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b1061192abd6ce2fe612ae4d1afb5890b318d2f07d4b0f6b0637119de5265ddffa9835735e11f56b2e747187d2ff509cae3b86e4186c93b87175115b36013a7ea9314066aa253ede451052ba71652577e6350320dbeda67d411a46f71d418077038f9c7dc9486746ad9ad089b38894568c00aeb02df7dda4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_020\"></a></p>\n<p>与之对应的，乌龟的受伤方式也很丰富，被压扁被束缚被电击，统计这玩意儿多少有点受虐狂了。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/43928e5351b6cf4cb5200e840d30451ee2f79f42029ae526ba3117cc59a4878e0c2b7fdad32c502aa7c83a3ffb0a27b3b6d480d58c14bc324c37b3d43aa44c5f7317599e5f89534106552baf42b7cdb34414c0df5801c79a8d64e194047810a733170bc74bd24e3b00c4060bba898e81931279ad79098fb1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_010\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/14482f0597c36280572307f9ee4288214e8fbad5e767aa2b993a4780c756a9c94d621f495530dcc8298913046a52659fa1e31dd3a9f79df525005eb9134f48634a933822c9c59f9feb04385ba04dc6894a980db6ef88f05279cb97b90de93ef1e26931e1d23f0c4cc15420628dd9cf357fa4f1590d22269c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_031\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/199ed1d0a167ad9ae39b80d256db1349ca7ba97d357329d750ad8833aa9dc292f9d9800183e7cdb87fe08969a86b5ce60c082a7d1ccea6613f4ee7c463ab11ae105a54f74adf1dff85849657896d7c67e46d245c71f06b013d6b8746093b4057fbbd38ac3f5f8cdb9a6f66c4acb00ad069c32547e291ec4c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_033\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b2bc39be60cc12cf5cbcf0d56d1393681bfa37275b7767cd464b32f5d88f85bb3e285ab5cde084a3a631e3aa9e9bec0aaea520946aa6afaf65c232f4f68f033911e74e4a15de47ec22f2f00f85c4e2b02f2c41c255dc1bf86198e1941599fc515ad5fba901d2c43ba2f57053e7547c0e0efb4130f74b2693\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_019\"></a></p>\n<p>故事方面好像是原创的，但也有说法是基于一个动画版改的，不管怎样都平平无奇。反正爱普莉儿又双叒叕被斯雷德抓走了。这次斯雷德和朗格玩了个大的，把整个曼哈顿搞成了个空岛，有种X-MEN电影的既视感。这也是副标题《曼哈顿计划》的由来。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/0957e9097aeba8023c831c4a555de64dccc368119586b037adfd530239754e3889b2d2d27570d9d7dcd7b628433b428e6592f4752f00934277be820d58be8c920417d9c7e28724d008a7af32104315fc2f2c772565b446605d2b5778df2e0f7f62f6d8da29e85a7dd66892c65f83e8453168268ebecfd5be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_002\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/0af4b84284ae9ee990266d81b23e747ff974f75a5b90b2f2a1b4e4d3924bfcb8ea11e69ac48d671b292041c6dd51f07c236b5704c3c551ff315015db1f715fa5ab34c1d773beedf9a2fe3a4a0a1e7004fe5b39aaa7c70d30b6637a4439accbdf4b8f1208b3e5e59081b915c4d09fa4a494e75d220976f49f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_001\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/857f809b9d46cfa8b720fa269632160aba1038f4d6b9c7120abb7559a5440e7d2fbe6eb28888d737c5f741e49f8b5db0e62f8161324e54072b4aa80b0327eaf367e095ca561d61945d27949a2579c65fd374501244e5a866a0e27fc092baa1f1eee7e64c405d0ac96c256c006fb0cf70adca3df20db3c5b6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_040\"></a></p>\n<p>前面几关BOSS除了牛头猪面这俩熟人，还有很多机械怪和变异怪，不少关卡还设置了些不咬人膈应人的中BOSS，不求要命命但求费血那种。其中见到斯雷德之前最难的是第五关的鳄鱼，甩尾巴那一下又快又狠。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/dd7f3365694779a292651956d6ba95737808d399c4bca87c4e827efa24f0364796c00ab1d0c31b68b044e07eb74f11dc6ea2801b38635b107900aff0d05fe3337e24215dd6cf84d94e1392ff16707b0f1524622509b5c7fb5b6b017aba34860dc4d07d947e8cbf90a2fd2290a341f501d52cbe4adb112fa5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_004\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/4b2866a088682e4ac0f4efe97937085cb914421b2574105ec81dd24b84b0e21a7b719cdcef2a672c1cdc2fb6fbb5ce37560671128b55e11d7e9e18522ba0191b516c026d984fa51b244eb9deda99ea09ccc597b1a7ff21973d2571f4a14d65d5ad8d8c49008aa0a506192499cbf7e4acc635de94e1988302\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_008\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2a355ab3176ca0fcafdb94e394680545dc688bd1c0a98bfa43492424f47cf8831000e33c5f7698a878b5cec0ffd75e8b4bce88ebe37024f72cb97ae0e8c84f051490b197a398d29930ce33061992b2ae8edc83b7af2b960344c0b91e512be35d22eb35aa8e32b4f6ca149313e6fc8199dc5abd8cadfc471b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_012\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3457375d7d481256c5ec062c257ac2137fa4a27291d6d30cefc434bc559ab6849272476df19b59301338f5b972e7b4cd239ce49f0aebfebed11adf68c01a60cd683f94f9b170bc36b1aa18b4cbbc714a7e31449b0ce2698f15f61b5262db4c76b2dcb7653e9fc4b79a2e656fa768d1e42eede501851bdaf1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_015\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fd0a1dbdaee38297b1477357f8111ba1103d3b0b7fd7c75df0b8bd404f10d2ea4b448142843092e2b64773436c3fd6765f6553980379437dae758001f2ded5d7b72a3fdeb5b11cc7b0c63216202679c7eef67eeaf93c01ab8080400287d305b15d30ca3d863567270cdddd3c7bec2509a4d715c78d18feca\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_021\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/c35d89b55139120ab0c84db90a1188a5dd716f9eb8cf8610d966e90200039179e07f481c537ae83eeca57b445a49ca5f3294ee155bb98793d41a89a4690ffbbd611ddaeb6fafc2fbff6891fbbbe87854f66f49db37c8fb56626785\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_024\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/fe1ac97a360a9059639e1d18b501cb0b3a3ae4fefe4b2cbe7c60cf2d76d79399397217d4b4d533fe7d17ea29d11701ea6a2bcc7ca1502d32ad1a2fa0cd0e04333d3fc6fecd687e772eb93adac161d9312bfd5ce60f57f770de471f632bde4e93261440b288a6bb341af85a20f0e460f8cade1872e4cea199\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_026\"></a></p>\n<p>下面就是打不死的斯雷德了。其实正常打不怎么难，压迫感甚至还没有上一代强。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b2a801beeaa39230b40e51389e728705b3f5e397a1e990d1449817a77c5a469a42e71fe4725508e3b0fc9e39817724f006304e52fe0c4d6d571d0008cbba7a34bc73ca0effbf07f0132965798d74aff4e5aded253946df6db777286e3c84d76d9a783288b9e6e91333994264eb17aae863a23c6aa6680cb5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_027\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/142b226f3835c37da4f7be56a73ea67fbab36e59eed420742013d4ae073a0c6798582b99105275430eb834fe99d02cc7fe1a055920ed29cd153fb889295b86ab6826af2c0c9d019a57407c678087e780cb39c1c82aeeae98d4aa3a9f45c93c43c1285407e432947ef132ffa3c96b585c269e61314123c232\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_028\"></a></p>\n<p>打完斯雷德之后还有还有两关，守关的是朗格和变异斯雷德。难倒是没多难，只是流程相当的长，打到这会儿注意力都下降了，手更是要搓出腱鞘炎了。以我这臭手当年5块钱都不一定能兜住底。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/b3e4870f34bdb4dbfab34f1da97cde6214707a998510885ac72d3daf616c7614a001987a152997cd2b36f0fd31682b76af22fdc9f6e095b218873eba1d50487d9b4ccbf36af8d7a7c9ad165522dc64bf67f9283c0f4158e1c9cc16479549f0cb0ccd7a799137fb7cc88991408151324762eb3a376a06116c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_029\"></a><br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/2a307172437dd25a1202a9ba0c5c015504e397680e79d051a4d377b1da51ba578f4365d458e052c75c91c712c44d56363dc57d9ff30fa2752415e4655c80bdb3d5dfdaa6ce243c0b51082e6391a53c184243c7cee76c39494f0b970186e306752abdfed75237f9275b2f7b2bb288d7d5c75eb02c0f61afc5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_034\"></a></p>\n<p>守关的斯雷德，形象莫名有点像《幽游白书》里的武威，技能是操控雷电，不过他放雷电大招的时候也是破绽最大的时候，抓机会一顿猛放大招就行。<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/3ca46352bd2696a117578c7d8ae163212c905603102647a3339834073dec7e316fa20b5c1430dc9dfa1405770eaa2f53b8b7995dc309e6a278eb591e90ab9c67c4832aba15f3838db599c7718aac3b272944ac9db42a45b5cc7d573bff2812cec79e11f9a57cc1c9dba5ab23ea12f17047dd185e02f89ee0\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_037\"></a></p>\n<p>通关！<br>\n怨念退散！<br>\n<a href=\"https://pewae.com/gayn/1ab7a2f7e5b26964e5a5ee43048c96e43f3e4f140a091f034f2b6ce6c0f0a36afde6c6a3565d344820d3d4a876aece7f25af2b3736b6bc0666346447b296ddb66faa5ddf926b32b8065f39026cc8f9e58435fb433381dbb37e041ea325b7dff150d751e86fea58485d80778e772d81aaac80e272bc1c764f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img alt=\"Teenage_Mutant_Ninja_Turtles_III_The_Manhattan_Project_038\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<div>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">(1)</a>：别问为啥用千问，问就是88VIP快到期了，不愿意多注册国产服务。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<div><span>《<a href=\"https://pewae.com/2026/10/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles-iii-the-manhattan-project.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">忍者神龟3</a>》采用<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">署名-非商业性使用-禁止演绎</a>许可协议进行许可。 『<a href=\"https://pewae.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破袜子</a>』期待与您交流。</span><div><div><h3>相关推荐:</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2024/09/mega-man-3.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">洛克人3</a><span>[47%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2009/05/e7bb9d-e68b9b.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">绝招</a><span>[43%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2006/07/teenage-mutant-ninja-turtles.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">激龟忍者传</a><span>[42%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2007/07/altered-beast.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">兽王记</a><span>[34%]</span></li><li><a href=\"https://pewae.com/2015/12/night-night.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">天天天黑</a><span>[33%]</span></li></ul></div></div></div>",
